/* Generate the coefficients in MOM_log.F90:log1p_tail_remez_4.
   Run from intrinsics/: sollya generators/generate_MOM_log_remez.sollya
   The interval includes the reduced arguments from the 128-bin [1, 2) table.
   Approximate (log(1+x)-x)/x^2; multiplication by x^2 gives the log1p tail. */
prec = 256!;
f = (log(1+x)-x)/x^2;
p = remez(f, 4, [-0.004;0.004]);
for i from 0 to 4 do print(coeff(p,i));
quit;
